{"unit_id":"WSL043__dsh-chat-manager#feature-archive-search","repo":"WSL043/dsh-chat-manager","commit":"7b9695593df5d4e72fb46cad5bbba36fe7484275","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Chat Manager 的功能「归档内容搜索」：按关键词搜索已归档的用户和助手消息，并显示匹配片段。用户在设置页输入查询；结果限 20 条，全文索引不可用时改用分批扫描。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:101-120","src/host/archive-manager.mjs:87-139"]}
{"unit_id":"WSL043__dsh-chat-manager#feature-unarchive","repo":"WSL043/dsh-chat-manager","commit":"7b9695593df5d4e72fb46cad5bbba36fe7484275","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Chat Manager 的功能「取消归档」：从设置页对归档会话执行 DSH 的公开取消归档操作，并保留工作区位置。用户点击对应行的取消归档按钮即可恢复会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:130-137","src/host/archive-manager.mjs:55-68"]}
{"unit_id":"WSL043__dsh-chat-manager#feature-confirm-delete","repo":"WSL043/dsh-chat-manager","commit":"7b9695593df5d4e72fb46cad5bbba36fe7484275","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Chat Manager 的功能「确认删除会话」：用户从归档设置页或会话菜单选中记录后，会看到带会话名称的确认框。确认后才向宿主发送删除请求，取消则关闭对话框。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:21-70","lib/client.js:77-85"]}
{"unit_id":"WSL043__dsh-chat-manager#feature-delete-eligible","repo":"WSL043/dsh-chat-manager","commit":"7b9695593df5d4e72fb46cad5bbba36fe7484275","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Chat Manager 的功能「清理已归档会话」：确认后删除符合条件的本机当前格式 JSONL 会话目录。只接受已归档且未加载的会话；宿主仍在使用、格式未知或无法取得独占写入句柄时会拒绝。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/delete-session.mjs:121-188","src/host/delete-session.mjs:190-257"]}
{"unit_id":"WSL043__dsh-chat-manager#feature-archive-reconcile","repo":"WSL043/dsh-chat-manager","commit":"7b9695593df5d4e72fb46cad5bbba36fe7484275","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Chat Manager 的功能「同步归档列表」：删除成功后调用公开取消归档操作，清除已移除会话的归档标记；如果标记更新失败，接口会返回未完成状态供界面提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/archive-manager.mjs:70-85","lib/client.js:47-54"]}
{"unit_id":"WSL043__dsh-chat-manager#caveat-permanent-delete","repo":"WSL043/dsh-chat-manager","commit":"7b9695593df5d4e72fb46cad5bbba36fe7484275","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Chat Manager 使用前须知：永久删除会移除已归档本机会话记录且无法恢复；仅支持未加载、当前格式的 JSONL 会话，已加载或未知格式会被拒绝。（见 src/host/delete-session.mjs:121-188）","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/delete-session.mjs:121-188"]}
